Tutor: Do you need anything?
#objective: Say yes — you need some help
#chunks: I need some help.,I need some information.,I need a little more time.,I need to leave now.,Do you need anything?
#user_input
Tutor: I also need a little more time.
#objective: Say no problem and be patient
#chunks: I need a little more time.,Do you need anything?
#user_input
Tutor: Do you need help with this question?
#objective: Yes — you don't understand this word
#chunks: I need some help.,I need some information.
#user_input
Tutor: Okay. I can explain it.
#objective: Say thanks — you need to finish today
#chunks: I need to leave now.,I need some help.
#user_input
Tutor: Take your time.
#objective: Say you think you can finish now
#chunks: I need a little more time.,Do you need anything?
#user_input
Tutor: Thanks. I think I can finish now.
#objective: Complete the exchange confidently
